	(text "Power: AA x3 (alkaline 4.5V / NiMH 3.6V) -> VBAT (motors) ; VBAT -> D1 Schottky -> VSYS (Pico). USB 5V can not back-feed the batteries. Never use 4 cells (Pico VSYS max 5.5V)."
